# Allowlist: this repository tracks only the workspace's own files. The
# repositories declared in flake.nix are checked out beneath it as
# independent clones, and they, the shared .worktrees/ root, the
# generated mani.yaml and shell state all stay out by default. Re-include
# anything else the workspace itself should track with a `!/name` line.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.envrc
!/flake.nix
!/flake.lock
